        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pat Ashton, Harry Booth, Reg Varney, Doris Hare\n- Works: On the Buses, Mutiny on the Buses\n- Topics: English TV-sitcom film spin-offs, British comedy films\n\nFacts:\n- In 1971, Pat Ashton appeared in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off \"On the Buses.\"\n- In 1971, \"On the Buses\" was released as a British comedy film directed by Harry Booth and starring Reg Varney and Doris Hare.\n- In 1972, Pat Ashton appeared in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off \"Mutiny on the Buses.\"\n- Pat Ashton is best remembered for her engaging cockney, blonde persona in \"On the Buses\" and \"Mutiny on the Buses.\"",
